            {
                "date": "2017-09-29",
                "text": "If you cast one of the revealed cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can't wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card's type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as \"Cast [this card] only during combat\") are not."
